values ('fq_merid_070', 'The Gravity Dividend', 'boss', 'S', 'MERIDIAN_CARTEL', 'CRADLE_EXPANSE', 'THE GRAVITY DIVIDEND PAYOUT. (Location: Cradle Expanse, Don Vercelli) The Cartel board declares the Gravity Titan a dividend asset. Defeat the Raid Boss Tier-3 entity and claim its gravity control technology. Whoever controls gravity controls the price of everything on Xylos.', '{"npc_id": "npc_cartel_boss", "name": "Don Vercelli", "location": "CRADLE_EXPANSE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 69, "reputation_required": 4080, "required_quests": ["fq_merid_069"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GRAVITY_TITAN", "count": 1, "desc": "CLAIM THE GRAVITY DIVIDEND.", "description": "Defeat Gravity Titan (x1)."}, {"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 5, "desc": "Clear competitor bidders.", "description": "Defeat Aethel Abyssal Reaver (x5)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "raw_aethel_fragment", "count": 1, "desc": "Confirm dividend payout complete.", "description": "Collect raw aethel fragment (x1). [Item: Raw Aethel Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 20000, "currency": 10000, "crd": 5000, "rep": 7000, "items": [{"item_id": "titan_core", "quantity": 3}, {"item_id": "gravity_well_core", "quantity": 2}, {"item_id": "event_horizon_fragment_l", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_merid_071', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_meridian.json', 69)
