values ('fq_omni_001', 'Asset Activated', 'story', 'D', 'OMNICORP', 'HIGHLAND_PLATEAU', 'Director Astra Vey of OmniCorp does not introduce herself the way other faction leaders do. The briefing arrives as a data packet: your activation code, your initial tasking, and a performance metric you are expected to meet. OmniCorp is a galaxy-spanning corporation that treats Xylos as a line item in a much larger balance sheet — and the Highland Plateau is the first asset to be optimized. Plateau Hares are causing sensor interference. Sanitize the zone. Efficiency is not requested. It is the baseline. Quest giver: Director Sterling at The Spire Executive Floor.', '{"npc_id": "npc_omnicorp_executive", "name": "Director Astra Vey", "location": "HIGHLAND_PLATEAU"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 1, "reputation_required": 0, "required_quests": []}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "PLATEAU_HARE", "count": 5, "desc": "Execute Sanitization Protocol on Plateau Hares.", "description": "Defeat Plateau Hare (x5)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "hare_hide", "count": 1, "desc": "Upload sensor calibration data to the Spire.", "description": "Collect hare hide (x1). [Item: Hare Hide]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 50, "currency": 30, "crd": 0, "rep": 30, "items": [{"item_id": "con_small_hp_cell", "quantity": 3}, {"item_id": "scrap_metal", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_omni_002', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_omnicorp.json', 0)
