values ('fq_omni_002', 'Recovery Protocol: Survey Fleet', 'story', 'D', 'OMNICORP', 'HIGHLAND_PLATEAU', 'OmniCorp''s Survey Bots are the most advanced autonomous assessment units on Xylos — which makes it particularly inconvenient that four of them have gone offline in the Highland Plateau''s northern grid sector. Director Vey''s analysis is concise: the Plateau Drones that are swarming the area malfunctioned when OmniCorp''s initial survey signals overwhelmed their primitive navigation systems. The Survey Bots'' data cores contain Xylos asset maps that no other faction has. Recover them before someone else does. Quest giver: Tech Officer 404 at Skybridge Reactor Control Room.', '{"npc_id": "npc_omnicorp_technician", "name": "Director Astra Vey", "location": "HIGHLAND_PLATEAU"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 1, "reputation_required": 5, "required_quests": ["fq_omni_001"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "OMNI_SURVEY_BOT", "count": 4, "desc": "Neutralize malfunctioning Survey Bots.", "description": "Defeat Omni Survey Bot (x4)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "sensor_chip", "count": 3, "desc": "Recover Survey Bot data cores.", "description": "Collect sensor chip (x3). [Item: Sensor Chip]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 55, "currency": 35, "crd": 0, "rep": 35, "items": [{"item_id": "scrap_circuit", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_omni_003', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_omnicorp.json', 1)
