values ('fq_omni_003', 'Calibration by Elimination', 'story', 'D', 'OMNICORP', 'HIGHLAND_PLATEAU', 'The Plateau Drones were OmniCorp''s own early-model survey units, deployed on the Highland Plateau in a previous assessment cycle and never retrieved — now operating outside their original parameters due to Xylos''s aethel-charged atmosphere corrupting their navigation firmware. Director Astra Vey considers them a known liability. Their salvage value is marginal. Their interference with current operations is not. OmniCorp''s standard approach to hardware that costs more to fix than to replace: controlled demolition. Quest giver: Director Sterling at The Spire Executive Floor.', '{"npc_id": "npc_omnicorp_executive", "name": "Director Astra Vey", "location": "HIGHLAND_PLATEAU"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 2, "reputation_required": 10, "required_quests": ["fq_omni_002"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "PLATEAU_DRONE", "count": 5, "desc": "Recalibrate Plateau Drones.", "description": "Defeat Plateau Drone (x5)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "circuit_fragment", "count": 2, "desc": "Submit debris for failure analysis.", "description": "Collect circuit fragment (x2). [Item: Circuit Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 70, "currency": 40, "crd": 0, "rep": 40, "items": [{"item_id": "damaged_servo_motor", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_omni_004', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_omnicorp.json', 2)
