values ('fq_omni_007', 'Deviation from Pattern', 'story', 'D', 'OMNICORP', 'EXTRACTION_ZONE_DELTA', 'OmniCorp''s Delta Mining Drones are the company''s flagship extraction hardware — designed to operate in precise coordinated patterns for maximum resource yield. (Location: Extraction Zone Delta, Chief Barrett) The aethel-charged mineral veins in Zone Delta have been disrupting their programming, causing erratic extraction behavior that is damaging the vein structures OmniCorp spent six months mapping. Director Vey''s engineering note is characteristically cold: ''Hardware performing outside design parameters is hardware requiring replacement.'' Terminate the deviant units.', '{"npc_id": "npc_extraction_chief", "name": "Director Astra Vey", "location": "EXTRACTION_ZONE_DELTA"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 6, "reputation_required": 25, "required_quests": ["fq_omni_006"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "DELTA_MINING_DRONE", "count": 5, "desc": "Reprogram Delta Mining Drones.", "description": "Defeat Delta Mining Drone (x5)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "circuit_fragment", "count": 1, "desc": "Submit mining output recalibration report.", "description": "Collect circuit fragment (x1). [Item: Circuit Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 120, "currency": 70, "crd": 0, "rep": 70, "items": [{"item_id": "mat_iron_ore", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_omni_009', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_omnicorp.json', 6)
