values ('fq_omni_009', 'Rogue Hardware: Termination Authorized', 'story', 'D', 'OMNICORP', 'EXTRACTION_ZONE_DELTA', 'OmniCorp''s Delta Assault Drones were security hardware — deployed to protect the extraction infrastructure from rival faction intrusion. (Location: Extraction Zone Delta, Chief Barrett) The aethel contamination in Zone Delta has corrupted their target identification systems and they are now attacking OmniCorp personnel. Director Astra Vey reviewed the incident report and flagged it with a single notation: ''Standard termination protocol. Hardware liability exceeds replacement cost. Asset destruction approved.'' She is already ordering the next generation of Assault Drones from the galactic supply chain.', '{"npc_id": "npc_extraction_chief", "name": "Director Astra Vey", "location": "EXTRACTION_ZONE_DELTA"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 8, "reputation_required": 30, "required_quests": ["fq_omni_007"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "DELTA_ASSAULT_DRONE", "count": 2, "desc": "Execute termination protocol.", "description": "Defeat Delta Assault Drone (x2)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "scrap_core", "count": 1, "desc": "Recover blackbox for failure analysis.", "description": "Collect scrap core (x1). [Item: Scrap Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 250, "currency": 150, "crd": 0, "rep": 150, "items": [{"item_id": "damaged_servo_motor", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_omni_010', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_omnicorp.json', 7)
