values ('fq_omni_010', 'Cluster Purge: No Redundancies', 'story', 'D', 'OMNICORP', 'EXTRACTION_ZONE_DELTA', 'The rogue Delta Assault Drones have networked into a command cluster — a self-organizing behavior their original programming was not supposed to allow, which suggests the aethel contamination has done something to their hardware that OmniCorp''s engineers find deeply uncomfortable to discuss. (Location: Extraction Zone Delta, Director Sterling) Director Vey''s assessment skips the engineering concern entirely: the cluster represents a processing bottleneck in Zone Delta''s operational throughput. Purge it completely. Redundancy is inefficiency. No defective unit leaves the zone operational.', '{"npc_id": "npc_omnicorp_executive", "name": "Director Astra Vey", "location": "EXTRACTION_ZONE_DELTA"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 9, "reputation_required": 35, "required_quests": ["fq_omni_009"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "DELTA_ASSAULT_DRONE", "count": 3, "desc": "Purge Assault Drone cluster.", "description": "Defeat Delta Assault Drone (x3)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "sensor_chip", "count": 1, "desc": "Confirm cluster purge complete.", "description": "Collect sensor chip (x1). [Item: Sensor Chip]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 300, "currency": 180, "crd": 0, "rep": 180, "items": [{"item_id": "processor_cooling_unit", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_omni_011', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_omnicorp.json', 8)
