values ('fq_omni_011', 'Legacy Hardware: Pre-Colonization Assets', 'story', 'C', 'OMNICORP', 'SECURE_MINING_GRID', 'The Secure Mining Grid predates OmniCorp''s formal Xylos colonization — it was built by an earlier survey operation whose records OmniCorp''s legal team absorbed through a corporate acquisition eighteen years ago. The hardware inside has been running continuously since before any of the current factions existed on Xylos. Director Vey''s interest is strategic: what technology did the previous operators have that OmniCorp does not? The answer could be worth considerably more than the Grid''s mineral output. Quest giver: Warden AI at Secure Mining Grid Checkpoint.', '{"npc_id": "npc_grid_security", "name": "Director Astra Vey", "location": "SECURE_MINING_GRID"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 10, "reputation_required": 40, "required_quests": ["fq_omni_010"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "travel", "target": "SECURE_MINING_GRID", "count": 1, "desc": "Enter the Secure Mining Grid.", "description": "Travel to SECURE MINING GRID. (Travel to: Secure Mining Grid)"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "ancient_scale", "count": 2, "desc": "Catalog recoverable hardware.", "description": "Collect ancient scale (x2). [Item: Ancient Scale]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 280, "currency": 150, "crd": 0, "rep": 150, "items": [{"item_id": "con_minor_stim_pack", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_omni_012', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_omnicorp.json', 9)
