values ('fq_omni_012', 'Outdated Patrol Protocols', 'story', 'C', 'OMNICORP', 'SECURE_MINING_GRID', 'The Grid Sentinel Drones are running on patrol protocols written for a different era — their zones of engagement were mapped before OmniCorp''s survey teams arrived, which means they are treating OmniCorp personnel as hostiles in their own asset. (Location: Secure Mining Grid, Warden AI) The Warden AI — an automated management system that has been running the Grid since before OmniCorp took ownership — acknowledges the problem but cannot update the Sentinel firmware without physical access to the patrol units. Achieve physical access. Forcefully.', '{"npc_id": "npc_grid_security", "name": "Director Astra Vey", "location": "SECURE_MINING_GRID"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 11, "reputation_required": 45, "required_quests": ["fq_omni_011"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GRID_SENTINEL_DRONE", "count": 5, "desc": "Update Grid Sentinel Drone patrol patterns.", "description": "Defeat Grid Sentinel Drone (x5)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "circuit_fragment", "count": 2, "desc": "Upload updated patrol data.", "description": "Collect circuit fragment (x2). [Item: Circuit Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 320, "currency": 170, "crd": 0, "rep": 170, "items": [{"item_id": "scrap_circuit", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_omni_013', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_omnicorp.json', 10)
