values ('fq_omni_015', 'Grid Efficiency: Unacceptable', 'story', 'C', 'OMNICORP', 'SECURE_MINING_GRID', 'Director Astra Vey''s operational report is terse: ''Secure Mining Grid efficiency: 67%. OmniCorp standard: 95%. Delta: -28 points. Status: unacceptable. Corrective action: immediate.'' The Sentinel Drones and Defenders still patrolling the Grid''s uncleared sectors are the primary efficiency bottleneck. Every unit still operating outside OmniCorp control is a percentage point of grid throughput that belongs to a previous operator. Remove them all. Restore the Grid to OmniCorp standard. Quest giver: Director Sterling at The Spire Executive Floor.', '{"npc_id": "npc_omnicorp_executive", "name": "Director Astra Vey", "location": "SECURE_MINING_GRID"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 14, "reputation_required": 60, "required_quests": ["fq_omni_014"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GRID_SENTINEL_DRONE", "count": 4, "desc": "Remove Sentinel inefficiencies.", "description": "Defeat Grid Sentinel Drone (x4)."}, {"type": "kill", "target": "GRID_DEFENDER", "count": 4, "desc": "Remove Defender inefficiencies.", "description": "Defeat Grid Defender (x4)."}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 500, "currency": 280, "crd": 0, "rep": 300, "items": [{"item_id": "scrap_circuit", "quantity": 4}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_omni_016', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_omnicorp.json', 13)
