values ('fq_omni_016', 'Processing Bottleneck: Cleared', 'story', 'C', 'OMNICORP', 'SECURE_MINING_GRID', 'The Grid Assault Units remaining in the Grid''s deep sectors are not simply holdovers — the Warden AI has flagged an anomalous behavior pattern: they are actively routing around OmniCorp''s new management protocols, creating processing dead zones that are costing the Grid 12% of its theoretical throughput. (Location: Secure Mining Grid, Warden AI) Director Vey finds this more interesting than concerning. Something in the previous operators'' programming is resisting OmniCorp''s override. She wants it studied — after it is eliminated.', '{"npc_id": "npc_grid_security", "name": "Director Astra Vey", "location": "SECURE_MINING_GRID"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 15, "reputation_required": 65, "required_quests": ["fq_omni_015"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GRID_ASSAULT_UNIT", "count": 4, "desc": "Eliminate processing bottleneck.", "description": "Defeat Grid Assault Unit (x4)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "scrap_core", "count": 1, "desc": "Report processing load restored.", "description": "Collect scrap core (x1). [Item: Scrap Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 520, "currency": 290, "crd": 0, "rep": 310, "items": [{"item_id": "power_regulator_core", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_omni_017', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_omnicorp.json', 14)
