values ('fq_omni_017', 'Pre-Colonization Schematics', 'story', 'C', 'OMNICORP', 'SECURE_MINING_GRID', 'The Warden AI has located four legacy data nodes in the Grid''s restricted sectors — nodes that contain pre-Xylos colonization schematics for technology that OmniCorp''s R&D division has flagged as potentially revolutionary. (Location: Secure Mining Grid, Tech Officer 404) Tech Officer 404 believes the schematics predate the Great Severance, which would make them the oldest technological records on the planet. Director Vey''s assessment: ''Competitive intelligence asset. Priority retrieval before rival faction access. Sentinel escorts are a secondary concern.'' They are not a secondary concern.', '{"npc_id": "npc_omnicorp_technician", "name": "Director Astra Vey", "location": "SECURE_MINING_GRID"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 16, "reputation_required": 70, "required_quests": ["fq_omni_016"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "collect", "target": "circuit_fragment", "count": 4, "desc": "Retrieve legacy data nodes.", "description": "Collect circuit fragment (x4). [Item: Circuit Fragment]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "GRID_SENTINEL_DRONE", "count": 3, "desc": "Clear data node perimeters.", "description": "Defeat Grid Sentinel Drone (x3)."}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 480, "currency": 260, "crd": 0, "rep": 260, "items": [{"item_id": "memory_fragment_chip", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_omni_018', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_omnicorp.json', 15)
