values ('fq_omni_070', 'Gravity Recalibration', 'boss', 'S', 'OMNICORP', 'CRADLE_EXPANSE', 'GRAVITY RECALIBRATION OPERATION. (Location: Cradle Expanse, Director Sterling) The Gravity Titan''s algorithm is the key to mass manipulation. Defeat the Raid Boss Tier-3 entity and download the complete algorithm. Omnicorp will control gravity itself.', '{"npc_id": "npc_omnicorp_executive", "name": "", "location": "CRADLE_EXPANSE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 69, "reputation_required": 4080, "required_quests": ["fq_omni_069"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GRAVITY_TITAN", "count": 1, "desc": "DOWNLOAD THE GRAVITY ALGORITHM.", "description": "Defeat Gravity Titan (x1)."}, {"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 5, "desc": "Clear download path obstacles.", "description": "Defeat Aethel Abyssal Reaver (x5)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "monster_material", "count": 1, "desc": "Confirm algorithm download.", "description": "Collect monster material (x1). [Item: Monster Material]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 20000, "currency": 10000, "crd": 5000, "rep": 7000, "items": [{"item_id": "titan_core", "quantity": 3}, {"item_id": "gravity_well_core", "quantity": 2}, {"item_id": "event_horizon_fragment_l", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_omni_071', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_omnicorp.json', 68)
